config AF_AGENT
	bool "AF_AGENT socket address family (ACB agents)"
	default y
	depends on AGENT
	help
	  Narrow transport address family over the ACB mailbox: socket
	  addresses carry kernel-minted AIDs, connect() enforces ACB
	  capability bits, sendmsg() enqueues skill requests and recvmsg()
	  waits for replies.  agent:// name resolution stays in user space.
